*)

(*"certification_schema.__title"
fundamentals_of_product_description_and_support
*)


(*"certification_schema"
The subject of the *certification_schema* is the definition of certifications. A certification assures and validates product data.

[example]
====
A material certificate states the chemical composition of one or more physical pieces of material, for example, purchased raw material. The presence of the material certificate removes the need to test the composition of the material; it allows the specified material composition to be accepted as fact without further investigation.
====

[example]
====
A certified supplier can supply goods that do not require checking.
====

*)
(*"certification_schema.__fund_cons"

Certification information can be attached to any aspect of product data.

*)
